  "_about": "Register map for the farm PLC's Modbus TCP server (G5, docs/PLC_PROGRAM.md, plc/src/11_ModbusMap.scl). One 16-bit holding register per value, 0-based address as sent on the wire; value = register / scale, signed. Layout: system 0-19, zone n at 100 + 10*(n-1) for up to 16 zones (100-259), pumps 270 and 280, command 300-307, fallback 318-399. Zone 'index' = the PLC's zone number (command target). Zone 'state' = state + 256 * run source. Panel modes: zones 0 auto, 1 on, 2 off; pumps 0 auto, 1 hand, 2 off. ack_status 1 accepted, 2 rejected; ack_reason codes in apps/simulator/src/adapters/plc_common.py.",
